OL,3,ANHS bosses warn of chaos in ADHD and
OL,4,Aautism care
OL,5,
OL,6,FAutism and ADHD care is at risk of
OL,7,Fdescending into chaos, NHS bosses are
OL,8,Fwarning, as costs spiral out of control
OL,9,Fand unregulated private providers
OL,10,Fcapitalise on the huge demand for help.
OL,12,FThe NHS Alliance, which represents
OL,13,Fhealth managers, says the current
OL,14,Fsystem represents a "bad deal" for
OL,15,Fpatients and taxpayers alike.
OL,17,FIt points to big variations in what the
OL,18,FNHS is being charged for assessments
OL,19,Fand care - in one case, a local health
OL,20,Fboard was paying #300 to #3,000 for
OL,21,Fsimilar services.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
